{"v":4,"catch":"要麼深入，要麼空手而歸。","desc":"你手握鏟子，懷抱夢想。腳下埋藏著什麼？一個充滿寶藏、科技與遠古奇物的世界，正等待著被發掘。\n\n劈開大地，出售發現，升級裝備。越往深處挖掘，越是詭異——古老錢幣、失落裝置、遺忘遺跡⋯⋯還有某些本該永埋地底之物。\n\n無計時限制。無壓力。唯有你、你的工具，以及探索的驚喜。聰明挖掘，大膽挖掘——若遇發光異物？呃...或許該慢慢後退。","publisher":"Fun Games Studio","release":"2026-02-12","genres":["模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.7GB / Switch 0.7GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/94e50014b0efbc0d53cfd4ae867a6713227dc6d96aa191c064a6e977de066515.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2e9a883a5848586ac4fe5a3ce60eedc2b9b04b5dbc15a7e102194330270eb75a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b09e086194159ee3c0ef43c286906516f73109637d8efd2bbe4cb867721469ce.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e1adb4fbabdf6e001779e2503b867a1c48ef82ae2564bf7babc539d3f3bb3b9d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e21e1034bfe39eedf1e2c294b0b56244333165d986f77bec252bfac9a6e0cbd8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/13ce904aa6f607f088a4428f7bc1fec80122e987dc20705926a8e5dae42514a6.jpg"],"titleId":"01009dc024c38000","dlc":[]}